
========================================================================
  ESSENTIAL 1-CYCLES AT n=5
========================================================================

  V=10, E=21, T=12
  rank(∂_1) = 9, nullity(∂_1) = 12
  rank(∂_2) = 10
  β_1 = nullity(∂_1) - rank(∂_2) = 12 - 10 = 2

  Spanning tree has 9 edges
  Non-tree edges: 12 (= fundamental cycles)

